# Accessing Panopto Videos via Blackboard Ultra (aka The VLE)

!!! Summary

    For the best experience, access your Panopto videos directly through your module site in Blackboard Ultra. Navigate to your course and select the video you need.

    For the best experience, use supported browsers (Chrome/Firefox), ensure a stable internet connection, and disable pop-up blockers. Keeping your browser updated will improve compatibility.


